erall Match</span>\n<div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-1.5\">\n<span class=\"text-headline-md font-headline-md text-primary font-bold\" id=\"sim-score\">94%</span>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary\" id=\"sim-pill\">Current baseline</span>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"text-right\">\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary\">Projected Screening Pass</span>\n<p class=\"text-title-md font-title-md text-tertiary font-bold\" id=\"sim-ats\">91% → 97%</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- Curated Fast-Track Remediation Modules -->\n<div class=\"bg-surface-container-lowest border border-surface-variant rounded-xl p-5 shadow-sm flex flex-col gap-4\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2\">\n<span class=\"material-symbols-outlined text-primary text-[20px]\" data-icon=\"bolt\">bolt</span>\n<h3 class=\"text-title-md font-title-md text-on-surface font-semibold\">Curated Fast-Track Paths</h3>\n</div>\n<span class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm text-tertiary font-medium bg-emerald-50 px-2 py-0.5 rounded border border-emerald-200\">Verified by Stripe Leads</span>\n</div>\n<!-- Path 1: Next.js -->\n<div class=\"p-4 rounded-xl border border-surface-variant bg-surface-bright flex flex-col gap-3\">\n<div class=\"flex items-start justify-between gap-2\">\n<div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5\">\n<span class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded bg-black text-white flex items-center justify-center font-bold text-[13px] shrink-0\">N</span>\n<div>\n<h4 class=\"text-label-lg font-label-lg text-on-surface font-semibold\">Next.js 14 App Router &amp; RSC</h4>\n<p class=\"text-label-sm font-label-sm text-secondary\">Interactive sandbox covering Server Actions &amp; cache tags</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<span class=\"px-2 py-0.5 rounded bg-surface-container text-on-surface text-label-sm font-label-sm font-medium shrink-0\">4.0 hrs</span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"flex items-center justify-between pt-1\">\n<div class=\"flex items-cent